TerraHelmetMelee:
	'''
	Increased life regen
	28% increased melee speed
	Being struck by an enemy causes an exploding terra sphere to home in on the enemy that attacked you
	'''
TerraHelmetRanged:
	'''
	Enemies are less likely to target you
	20% increased ranged critical strike chance
	Striking an enemy with a ranged projectile may cause a terra bullet to fire at the target
	'''
TerraHelmetMage:
	'''
	Automatically use mana potions when needed
	Mana cost is multiplied by 60%
	Pressing the Armor Ability hotkey causes 2 terra rose stalks to grow around you
	Enemies struck by the stalks drop mana stars
	'''
TerraHelmetSummoner:
	'''
	Summons a powerful terra crystal to shoot at nearby enemies
	Pressing the Armor Ability hotkey toggles the crystal between offense, defense, and support
	While in offense mode the crystal will chase and rapidly shoot down enemies
	While in defensive mode the crystal will stay above you and shoot down nearby enemies
	While in support mode your defense and life regeneration are increased significantly, but your damage is cut in half
	'''
